t the rollout now, and don't discipline staff or withdraw the app. Keep the pilot under its pause criteria. Show falls as rates with the reporting change marked. Start manual sampling of night call-bell response times. Review admissions mix and medication changes. Decide on the rollout at a dated review in late January with Q4 data.\n","numLines":19,"startLine":1,"totalLines":19}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01VTpCfEQovFy7A8vZUaBWYE","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
